[ti:Ve Haaniyaan]
[ar:Danny • Avvy Sra]

[00:07.50]Tere kolon mainu saah milde,
[00:11.50]Assi aivein ni tainu bewajah milde
[00:15.50]Tere ch koi gall ae sahiba,
[00:19.50]Haan assi tainu tan milde
[00:23.50]Mainu pata nahi hunda sukoon ki,
[00:27.50]Tainu mile tan pata laggeya
[00:31.50]Mit gayi meri sab tanhai,
[00:35.50]Jee tere kol aa laggeya
[00:39.50]Ve haaniyaan ve dil jaaniya,
[00:43.50]Tu nehde nehde reh na door kite ja
[00:47.50]Bhull gaye eh saari duniya,
[00:51.50]Ke tera hi naam hai boldi zubaan
[01:19.50]Eh jo sadde naal hoya ae,
[01:23.50]Khoobsurat sapna lagdae
[01:27.50]Ajnabee si kal tak jo,
[01:31.50]Haan hun mainu apna lagdae
[01:35.50]Tu hi din tu hi meri raat,
[01:39.50]Koyi nahi hai tere toh bina
[01:43.50]Ve haaniyaan ve dil jaaniya,
[01:47.50]Tu nehde nehde reh na door kite ja
[01:55.50]Bhull gaye eh saari duniya,
[01:59.50]Ke tera hi naam hai boldi zubaan
[02:07.50]Tainu vekhi jaawan main haye,
[02:11.50]Ishq tere vich gaawan main
[02:15.50]Mere dil nu mil gaya raah,
[02:19.50]Jad tainu gal laawan main
[02:23.50]Ke likheya si sadda milna,
[02:27.50]Tu aiddan milna eh nahi si pata
[02:31.50]Ve haaniyaan ve dil jaaniya,
[02:35.50]Tu nehde nehde reh na door kite ja
[02:39.50]Bhull gaye eh saari duniya,
[02:43.50]Ke tera hi naam hai boldi zubaan
